  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_3376.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La comida de paella en la calle Alfonso Pallar&eacute;s ha centrado este domingo el fin de las fiestas del barrio del Cam&iacute; Castell&oacute; y adyacentes, en Onda, que se iniciaron el viernes de la semana pasada y dan paso a las fiestas de verano en el resto de barrios y la pedan&iacute;a de Artesa.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3364.jpg\" alt=\"img_3364\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3365.jpg\" alt=\"img_3365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3366.jpg\" alt=\"img_3366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3367.jpg\" alt=\"img_3367\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3368.jpg\" alt=\"img_3368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3369.jpg\" alt=\"img_3369\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3370.jpg\" alt=\"img_3370\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3371.jpg\" alt=\"img_3371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellafinalfestesbarricastello/img_3372.jpg\" alt